---
import BaseLayout from './../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageHtml = "<!-- ============ 1 · HERO ============ -->\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"hero\" data-screen-label=\"Hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero__reel\">\n    <div class=\"frame-media\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero__video\">\n      <div class=\"yt-bg\">\n        <iframe\n          src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/YkWCkew6OGg?autoplay=1&mute=1&controls=0&loop=1&playlist=YkWCkew6OGg&playsinline=1&modestbranding=1&rel=0&iv_load_policy=3&disablekb=1&fs=0&origin=https://sezmoo.com\"\n          title=\"SEZMOO showreel\"\n          allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\"\n          referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n          loading=\"eager\"></iframe>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero__grad\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"hero__hud tr\">\n    <div>SEZMOO / CREATIVE AGENCY</div>\n    <div style=\"color:var(--fg-faint);margin-top:6px\">4K · 25FPS · GDAŃSK / PL</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"shell hero__content\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow hero__label\"><span class=\"tick\"></span>Showreel 2026</span>\n    <div class=\"hero__measure\">\n    <h1>\n      <span class=\"clip\"><span>From idea</span></span>\n      <span class=\"clip\"><span>to <em class=\"accent\" style=\"font-style:normal\">delivery.</em></span></span>\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"hero__sub\">Films, social media, graphics and physical production for brands that want to be seen.</p>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"hero__sub\" style=\"font-size:clamp(15px,1.15vw,18px);color:var(--fg-dim);max-width:min(100%,calc(10.2 * clamp(34px,6.2vw,112px)));margin-top:16px;line-height:1.6\">We work end to end – from concept to finished materials ready to use in campaigns and on site. We combine <b>film production and photography</b>, <b>social media content</b> and <b>offline and online visual communication.</b> We are based in Gdańsk, but we deliver projects across the country and abroad.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero__cta\">\n      <a href=\"/../en/portfolio/\" class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-magnetic><span class=\"ico\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">See portfolio</span></a>\n      <a href=\"#kontakt\" class=\"btn\" data-magnetic><span class=\"lbl\">Let’s talk</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 2 · WORK / PORTFOLIO ============ -->\n<section class=\"work shell\" id=\"work\" data-screen-label=\"Work\">\n  <div class=\"sec-head\">\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title reveal\">Our <span style=\"color:#ffd200\">projects.</span><br>Recent months.</h2>\n    <span class=\"sec-index reveal\">OUR PROJECTS</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"work-slider reveal\">\n    <div class=\"work-reel\" data-bands=\"3\">\n\n    <a class=\"card reveal\" href=\"/../realizacja-exlantix/\" data-cats=\"eventy\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <div class=\"card__media\">\n        <img class=\"card__video\" src=\"/assets/portfolio/exlantix/exlantix-premiera-marki-gdansk-fotografia-21.jpg\" alt=\"EXLANTIX brand launch in Gdańsk – event, photo and video\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"card__scan\"></div><div class=\"card__sweep\"></div>\n        <div class=\"card__tc\"><span class=\"rd\"></span>TC 00:10:00</div>\n        <div class=\"card__live\">▶ EVENT</div>\n        <span class=\"card__play\">CASE</span>\n        <div class=\"card__bar\"><i></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card__info\"><div><div class=\"card__client\">EXLANTIX</div><div class=\"card__cat\">Brand premiere / Event</div></div><span class=\"card__tag\">CASE</span></div>\n    </a>\n<a class=\"card reveal\" href=\"/../realizacja-world-of-warships/\" data-cats=\"eventy\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <div class=\"card__media\">\n        <img class=\"card__video\" src=\"/assets/work/captains-club-int.avif\" alt=\"World of Warships\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"card__scan\"></div><div class=\"card__sweep\"></div>\n        <div class=\"card__tc\"><span class=\"rd\"></span>TC 00:23:57</div>\n        <div class=\"card__live\">▶ EVENT</div>\n        <span class=\"card__play\">CASE</span>\n        <div class=\"card__bar\"><i></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card__info\"><div><div class=\"card__client\">World of Warships</div><div class=\"card__cat\">Captain's Club / Event</div></div><span class=\"card__tag\">CASE</span></div>\n    </a>\n<a class=\"card reveal\" href=\"/realizacja-k2/\" data-cats=\"grafika\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <div class=\"card__media\">\n        <img class=\"card__video\" src=\"/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-hodowla-pstraga-zdjecie-z-drona-baseny.webp\" alt=\"K2 Fish Farm – rebrand, website, photography and drone film\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"card__scan\"></div><div class=\"card__sweep\"></div>\n        <div class=\"card__tc\"><span class=\"rd\"></span>TC 00:14:02</div>\n        <div class=\"card__live\">▶ CASE</div>\n        <span class=\"card__play\">CASE</span>\n        <div class=\"card__bar\"><i></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card__info\"><div><div class=\"card__client\">Hodowla Ryb K2</div><div class=\"card__cat\">Rebrand / Website / Drone</div></div><span class=\"card__tag\">CASE</span></div>\n    </a>\n<a class=\"card reveal\" href=\"/realizacja-baltic-towers-rekrutacja/\" data-cats=\"video\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <div class=\"card__media\">\n        <img class=\"card__video\" src=\"/assets/portfolio/baltic-towers-foto/baltic-towers-fotografia-przemyslowa-produkcja-01.jpg\" alt=\"Baltic Towers – recruitment campaign, film and production photography\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"card__scan\"></div><div class=\"card__sweep\"></div>\n        <div class=\"card__tc\"><span class=\"rd\"></span>TC 00:09:41</div>\n        <div class=\"card__live\">▶ CASE</div>\n        <span class=\"card__play\">CASE</span>\n        <div class=\"card__bar\"><i></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card__info\"><div><div class=\"card__client\">Baltic Towers</div><div class=\"card__cat\">Recruitment / Video / Photo</div></div><span class=\"card__tag\">CASE</span></div>\n    </a>\n<a class=\"card reveal\" href=\"/realizacja-doraco-hala-tvp/\" data-cats=\"video\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <div class=\"card__media\">\n        <img class=\"card__video\" src=\"/assets/portfolio/doraco-tvp/doraco-hala-zdjeciowa-tvp-zdjecia-z-drona-01.jpg\" alt=\"DORACO – TVP studio hall, film and drone photography\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"card__scan\"></div><div class=\"card__sweep\"></div>\n        <div class=\"card__tc\"><span class=\"rd\"></span>TC 00:09:41</div>\n        <div class=\"card__live\">▶ CASE</div>\n        <span class=\"card__play\">CASE</span>\n        <div class=\"card__bar\"><i></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card__info\"><div><div class=\"card__client\">DORACO × TVP</div><div class=\"card__cat\">Film / Photo / Drone</div></div><span class=\"card__tag\">CASE</span></div>\n    </a>\n<a class=\"card reveal\" href=\"/realizacja-soho-form/\" data-cats=\"grafika\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <div class=\"card__media\">\n        <img class=\"card__video\" src=\"/assets/portfolio/soho-form/soho-fotel.webp\" alt=\"Soho Form – logo, brand manual and website\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"card__scan\"></div><div class=\"card__sweep\"></div>\n        <div class=\"card__tc\"><span class=\"rd\"></span>TC 00:21:37</div>\n        <div class=\"card__live\">▶ CASE</div>\n        <span class=\"card__play\">CASE</span>\n        <div class=\"card__bar\"><i></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card__info\"><div><div class=\"card__client\">Soho Form</div><div class=\"card__cat\">Branding / Website</div></div><span class=\"card__tag\">CASE</span></div>\n    </a>\n\n\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"work-slider__hud reveal\">\n    <button class=\"work-nav\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous work\" data-reel-prev>‹</button>\n    <div class=\"work-dots\" data-reel-dots></div>\n    <span class=\"work-reel__count\" data-reel-count><b>01</b> / 02</span>\n    <button class=\"work-nav\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next work\" data-reel-next>›</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:clamp(36px,4.5vw,64px)\">\n    <a href=\"/portfolio-en/\" class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-magnetic><span class=\"ico\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">See full portfolio</span></a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 3 · WHAT WE DO ============ -->\n<section class=\"services shell\" id=\"services\" data-screen-label=\"Services\">\n  <div class=\"services-static reveal\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head\">\n        <h2 class=\"sec-title reveal\">Our <span style=\"color:#ffd200\">services.</span></h2>\n        <span class=\"sec-index reveal\">CONTENT SYSTEM</span>\n      </div>\n      \n      <style>\n      .services-static{margin-top:clamp(30px,4.5vh,60px)}\n      .svc__ico { display:block; width:30px; height:30px; color:#ffd200; margin:0 0 clamp(12px,1.2vw,18px);\n        opacity:.9; transition: transform .5s var(--ease), opacity .4s var(--ease); }\n      .svc:hover .svc__ico { opacity:1; }\n      .fmt-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:clamp(26px,4vw,66px);align-items:center;margin-top:clamp(28px,4vh,52px)}\n      .fmt2{position:relative;background:#0c0b09;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:clamp(18px,2.1vw,28px);overflow:hidden}\n      .fmt2::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.022) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.022) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:40px 40px;pointer-events:none}\n      .fmt2__hud{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);margin-bottom:15px}\n      .fmt2__hud .dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffd200;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle}\n      .fmt2__master{position:relative;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#111;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}\n      .fmt2__frames{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:9px}\n      .fmt2__frames i{flex:1;height:clamp(44px,6vw,62px);border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,210,0,.24),rgba(255,255,255,.05))}\n      .fmt2__frames i:nth-child(even){background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.1),rgba(255,255,255,.03))}\n      .fmt2__sprk{height:11px;background:#0a0a09;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 8px,rgba(255,255,255,.13) 8px 13px)}\n      .fmt2__mlbl{position:absolute;top:8px;left:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);padding:3px 7px;border-radius:3px}\n      .fmt2__split{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:14px 0;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffd200;white-space:nowrap}\n      .fmt2__split::before,.fmt2__split::after{content:\"\";flex:1;height:1px;background:rgba(255,210,0,.26)}\n      .fmt2__outs{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\n      .fmt2__out{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:13px 14px;border-radius:9px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}\n      .fmt2__shape{flex:none;background:rgba(255,210,0,.16);border:1px solid rgba(255,210,0,.5);border-radius:2px}\n      .s-169{width:44px;height:25px}.s-916{width:20px;height:36px}.s-11{width:32px;height:32px}.s-ban{width:48px;height:16px}\n      .fmt2__out .r{display:block;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#ffd200;margin-bottom:4px}\n      .fmt2__out h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:720;font-stretch:104%;font-size:clamp(14px,1.1vw,17px);line-height:1;color:#f4f0e6;margin:0}\n      .fmt2__out p{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.35;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);margin:5px 0 0}\n      .fmt-copy .eyebrow{margin-bottom:18px}\n      .fmt-copy__title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-stretch:104%;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,52px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px)}\n      .fmt-copy__p{color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:clamp(15px,1.15vw,17px);line-height:1.6;max-width:44ch;margin:0 0 clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px)}\n      @media(max-width:1000px){.fmt-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}}\n      @media(max-width:520px){.fmt2__outs{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n      </style>\n      <div class=\"fmt-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"fmt2\">\n          <div class=\"fmt2__hud\"><span><span class=\"dot\"></span>1 shoot</span><span>4K · 25FPS · Gdańsk</span></div>\n          <div class=\"fmt2__master\">\n            <div class=\"fmt2__sprk\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fmt2__frames\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n            <div class=\"fmt2__sprk\"></div>\n            <span class=\"fmt2__mlbl\">MASTER · on set</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fmt2__split\">one shoot → 4 formats</div>\n          <div class=\"fmt2__outs\">\n            <div class=\"fmt2__out\"><span class=\"fmt2__shape s-169\"></span><div><span class=\"r\">16:9</span><h4>Hero film</h4><p>Website, YouTube, decks</p></div></div>\n            <div class=\"fmt2__out\"><span class=\"fmt2__shape s-916\"></span><div><span class=\"r\">9:16</span><h4>Reels / Shorts</h4><p>Reels, TikTok, Shorts</p></div></div>\n            <div class=\"fmt2__out\"><span class=\"fmt2__shape s-11\"></span><div><span class=\"r\">1:1</span><h4>Social ads</h4><p>Paid campaigns</p></div></div>\n            <div class=\"fmt2__out\"><span class=\"fmt2__shape s-ban\"></span><div><span class=\"r\">Billboards / Web</span><h4>Campaign creative</h4><p>Banners, thumbnails, KV</p></div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fmt-copy\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"tick\"></span>What you get</span>\n          <h3 class=\"fmt-copy__title\">We never stop<br>at one film.</h3>\n          <p class=\"fmt-copy__p\">From the footage shot on set we build a full publishing kit: spots, reels, graphics, ad formats, thumbnails, landing pages and campaign design. Video is the backbone; the rest makes the content work across every channel.</p>\n          <a href=\"/../en/services/\" class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-magnetic><span class=\"ico\"></span><span class=\"lbl\">Plan production</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"svc-grid\">\n    <a class=\"svc reveal svc--pillar\" href=\"/services/video-production-reels/\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <svg class=\"svc__arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M19 5H8M19 5v11\"/></svg>\n      <div class=\"svc__body\">\n        <svg class=\"svc__ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"4.5\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M7 4.5v15M17 4.5v15M2.5 9.5h4.5M2.5 14.5h4.5M17 9.5h4.5M17 14.5h4.5\"/></svg>\n        <h3 class=\"svc__title\">Film production &amp; motion design</h3>\n        <p class=\"svc__desc\">Commercials, reels, event coverage, drone, editing and animation, from shoot to final export.</p>\n        <div class=\"svc__chips\"><span>video</span><span>spoty</span><span>reels</span><span>event recap</span><span>motion / 3D</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"svc reveal svc--pillar\" href=\"/services/social-media-management/\" data-d=\"1\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <svg class=\"svc__arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M19 5H8M19 5v11\"/></svg>\n      <div class=\"svc__body\">\n        <svg class=\"svc__ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"6.5\" y=\"2.5\" width=\"11\" height=\"19\" rx=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M10.5 5.4h3\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"18\" r=\"1\"/></svg>\n        <h3 class=\"svc__title\">Social &amp; campaign content</h3>\n        <p class=\"svc__desc\">Ongoing production of formats for social media, paid campaigns, launches, promotions and sales communication.</p>\n        <div class=\"svc__chips\"><span>content plan</span><span>ads</span><span>launch</span><span>formaty 9:16 / 1:1</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"svc reveal svc--pillar\" href=\"/services/graphic-design/\" data-d=\"2\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <svg class=\"svc__arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M19 5H8M19 5v11\"/></svg>\n      <div class=\"svc__body\">\n        <svg class=\"svc__ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.2 3.9l4.9 4.9M3.5 20.5l1.2-5 11-11 4.9 4.9-11 11-5.1 1.1Z\"/><path d=\"M12.7 6.4l4.9 4.9\"/></svg>\n        <h3 class=\"svc__title\">Design &amp; brand materials</h3>\n        <p class=\"svc__desc\">Graphics, key visuals, catalogues, banners, billboards, print and offline visual communication.</p>\n        <div class=\"svc__chips\"><span>KV</span><span>banery</span><span>print</span><span>social assets</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"svc reveal svc--pillar\" href=\"/services/websites-and-landing-pages/\" data-d=\"3\" data-cursor=\"link\">\n      <svg class=\"svc__arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M19 5H8M19 5v11\"/></svg>\n      <div class=\"svc__body\">\n        <svg class=\"svc__ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3.2 9.6h17.6M3.2 14.4h17.6M12 3c2.4 2.4 3.6 5.4 3.6 9s-1.2 6.6-3.6 9c-2.4-2.4-3.6-5.4-3.6-9S9.6 5.4 12 3Z\"/></svg>\n        <h3 class=\"svc__title\">Web &amp; digital support</h3>\n        <p class=\"svc__desc\">Landing pages, campaign sites and digital support that ties the content publishing together.</p>\n        <div class=\"svc__chips\"><span>landing</span><span>WWW</span><span>formularze</span><span>kampanie digital</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 4 · STUDIO ============ -->\n<section class=\"studio shell\" id=\"studio\" data-screen-label=\"Studio\">\n  <div class=\"sec-head\">\n    <span class=\"sec-index reveal\" style=\"order:2\">STUDIO</span>\n    <span class=\"eyebrow reveal\"><span class=\"tick\"></span>Why SEZMOO</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"studio__grid\">\n    <div class=\"studio__sticky reveal\">\n      <div class=\"studio__media is-vertical\" data-parallax=\"26\">\n        <div class=\"frame-media\" style=\"transform:translateY(var(--py,0))\"></div>\n        <div class=\"yt-bg\">\n          <iframe\n            src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/b_MB9qpw6jE?autoplay=1&mute=1&controls=0&loop=1&playlist=b_MB9qpw6jE&playsinline=1&modestbranding=1&rel=0&iv_load_policy=3&disablekb=1&fs=0&origin=https://sezmoo.com\"\n            title=\"SEZMOO · zespół\"\n            allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\"\n            referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ovl\">\n          <div class=\"corners\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"tc\"><span class=\"d\"></span><span data-tc>00:00:12:08</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"studio__title reveal\">One team.<br><span class=\"accent\">Full brand communication.</span></h2>\n      <p class=\"studio__copy\">SEZMOO is a creative agency with 14 years of marketing experience, based in Gdańsk. We bring every key marketing area together in one place – from photo and video production, through graphic and web design, to online marketing (social media and paid campaigns) and offline marketing with our own production. As a creative team we work project by project, but we also offer a retainer model – for brands that need ongoing production. That lets us run projects end to end: from idea and creative to finished materials rolled out in digital and in the real world.</p>\n      <div class=\"studio__points\">\n        <div class=\"spt\"><span class=\"spt__no\">01</span><span class=\"spt__txt\">We think in channels.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"spt\"><span class=\"spt__no\">02</span><span class=\"spt__txt\">We produce efficiently.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"spt\"><span class=\"spt__no\">03</span><span class=\"spt__txt\">We deliver the whole campaign.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ 5 · TEAM ============ -->\n<section class=\"team shell\" id=\"team\" data-screen-label=\"Team\">\n  <div class=\"sec-head\">\n    <h2 class=\"sec-title reveal\">Team.</h2>\n    <span class=\"sec-index reveal\">TEAM</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"team__grid team__grid--photos\">\n    <article class=\"team-card reveal\" data-d=\"0\">\n      <div class=\"team-card__photo\">\n        <span class=\"tc-ini\" aria-hidden=\"true\">MT</span>\n        <img class=\"tc-ph\" src=\"/assets/team/maciej-tyma.png\" alt=\"Maciej Tyma\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"team-card__body\">\n        <span class=\"team-card__no\">T·01</span>\n        <h3 class=\"team-card__name\">Maciej Tyma</h3>\n        <p class=\"team-card__role\">Founder · Photographer &amp; Video Producer</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"team-card reveal\" data-d=\"1\">\n      